[en.FOCUS_C03_MUFFIN_29]
Muffin!

[en.FOCUS_C03_MUFFIN_29_desc]
“Oh, Derpy Hooves, your message clear,”\n“Embrace our flaws, hold them dear,”\n“For in imperfection, we find beauty’s seed,”\n“A reminder that perfection’s not what we need.”

[en.FOCUS_C03_MUFFIN_29_TOOLTIP]
Citizens of Cloudsdale is thinking about Saint Derpy Hooves, but what exactly they are thinking about, Derpy will never know, nor need to know.

[en.FOCUS_C03_MUFFIN_29_TRIGGER_TOOLTIP]
